{"summary":"Kids letter tracing technique, which is the first step in learning how to write.","description":"<b>Advisory Alert:</b> Alive Alphabet’s amazing and amusing alphabetic adventure ahead!\n\nFrom Antelope to Zebra, Alive Alphabet thrills your children as they watch each letter come to life after tracing.\n\n26 animals with attitude help teach letter forms and letter tracing and writing techniques through their comical antics. What better way to learn letter basics than with a silly saxophone-playing flamingo and a rascally rummaging raccoon! \n\nThis helps to reinforce each letter and encourage kids to continue their alphabetic accomplishments.\n\nNot only do kids learn the letters of the alphabet and how to write them, they also learn the names of 26 animals that each begin with a different letter. \n\nThere are surprises around every corner! So get ready, set, learn!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rskhJd-8DP8?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/AK4Q4dhLYVpz4vIotD77SjqVMoEzaDhnChqkL1Pveo9KMQhGPBkK58CUhoanQ51Hm323Z84a_e5197H7ygJv","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WqR6WCWy8JSmsFk66xRR0FL75fL0CLsXUeVKbby7vtscFDWFoHOYsNOBHra6BLzP7H42hkKXRmr0EFClgZAW","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7ZpTXIDzCa0IwxaM3n2KPoH-BTTNL8vHWlRWJqUn1uG8QLuPsEtbATb1-wEgj5W1o4Z03DqbOEQTFPeTRDNHpg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Z5N7ijZ0q2Fwm6kACCTkfdfrLE1gE18X8EbliDM5cWSel9e80uEyMkaStfZZE5w6fBEZ9gMuqvHyQ4dzyenAfp4","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6m72-P8QzRCaqB_7Chcp-0m6cJAPlgEcjFxc3fQfJlP1Tw9z8UiyCQam0GPTT9-V8fWlpPjGtXYbdDAmqDupAw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vgFzHEIN1AkDRBkJQoYzm76PVmzcRa6xBG1UPzNH_DI9W1EWQdP07cuWYmUt0e41vxjyIEuD4boFtp4gNC73","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WqR6WCWy8JSmsFk66xRR0FL75fL0CLsXUeVKbby7vtscFDWFoHOYsNOBHra6BLzP7H42hkKXRmr0EFClgZAW","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7ZpTXIDzCa0IwxaM3n2KPoH